<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Cirrus Logic raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cirrus Logic raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it raised its rating of Cirrus Logic Inc to a buy from its previous rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- Cowen said its raised its 1997 earnings per share estimates by $0.19 to $0.26. It raised its 1998 earnings per share estimates by $0.45 to $1.23.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/8 to 20.</p>
</text>
